      "url": "https://www.machgen.ai/docs/rest_api/models/gpt-image-2-6#pricing",
      "text": "Both models price each image using the estimated output tokens for its dimensions and quality. Generation and editing share the same price for a given output size and quality. Each reference adds 1.048576 megapixels at the baseline rate, regardless of its uploaded size, once per generated image. Masks do not add a reference charge. Automatic and omitted quality reserve the max price, then charge the quality actually returned. Any difference is refunded at your original discounted rate."
