    {
      "url": "https://www.machgen.ai/docs/rest_api/models/gpt-image-2-6#pricing",
      "text": "For example, 1920×1088 at max has a list price of $0.159 per image at the standard rate. Generate shows your estimate, including applicable discounts, before submission."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://www.machgen.ai/docs/rest_api/models/gpt-image-2-6#pricing",
      "text": "GIF pricing includes every delivered frame. Automatic size reserves the maximum output cost for the selected quality, multiplied by the requested GIF frames. Any unused amount is returned after completion. SVG authoring is included."
